  "question": {
    "text": "Axis of a parabola lies along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis. If its vertex and focus are at distances <math><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mn>4</mn></math> respectively from the origin, on the positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis then which of following points does not lie on it?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0109_84c40cfe09c1.png\" style=\"width: 305px; height: 250px;\" /><br />Clearly vertex is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and focus is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> .</p><p>Hence, the equation of parabola is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>Point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> does not lie on the parabola.</p>"
  }
